<%# locals: (f:, point:) -%>
<%= render "web/site_helpers/forms/source_field", f: f, point: point %>
<div><%= f.label :lower, "Limite inferior", class: "ss-label" %><%= f.text_field :lower, value: point.address["lower"], class: "ss-input num", inputmode: "decimal" %></div>
<div><%= f.label :upper, "Limite superior", class: "ss-label" %><%= f.text_field :upper, value: point.address["upper"], class: "ss-input num", inputmode: "decimal" %></div>
<div><%= f.label :hysteresis, "Histerese", class: "ss-label" %><%= f.text_field :hysteresis, value: point.address["hysteresis"] || 0, class: "ss-input num", inputmode: "decimal" %></div>
<p class="sm:col-span-2 text-xs text-muted">Só o inferior: liga abaixo dele. Só o superior: liga acima. Os dois: liga dentro da faixa. A histerese evita liga-desliga perto do limite.</p>
